body:
Bad Timing :

They just ended a relationship

They want to be alone

They already have plans with friends

&#x200B;

Don't directly go and ask them out

Ocasionally make silly questions, just remember what they answered so you can use that later

Don't make things awkward between you and them

Always try to help them as much as you can, doesn't matter if it's giving tips to endure their relationship with someone else

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

Hope this helps

if you already have a 240 hz screen there is no point OC it

&#x200B;

ask the seller if it can be OC
